{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"Your own dance??? OF COURSE!\" he does a little jig. \"You could dance a little like this?\" He squats and kicks his legs out like traditional russian dancing \"Or maybe some of this? Or...\" He proceeds to run through the Evolution of Dance (like the old youtube meme).","created_at":"2020-07-28T23:42:20.823000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737817251851272254","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
